        "category": "defensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Soul Cages are immobile constructs fueling Faltyr's magic. They do not actively participate in combat, and can only use two actions: Spell Reflection and Contained Magic.</p><p>They can be disabled using one of the following checks, which disables their Contained Magic ability, reduces their Hardness, and affects some of Faltyr's abilities, but does not have any other effects.</p><p>Alternatively, a critical hit dealing damage to the Soul Cage reduces the Hardness as well, but does not disable any abilities.</p><p>@Check[type:thievery|dc:31|name:Crack the hourglass|traits:action:disable-a-device] (Expert)</p><p>@Check[type:arcana|dc:29|name:Displace the enchantments|traits:action:disable-a-device] @Check[type:nature|dc:29|name:Displace the enchantments|traits:action:disable-a-device] @Check[type:religion|dc:29|name:Displace the enchantments|traits:action:disable-a-device] @Check[type:occultism|dc:29|name:Displace the enchantments|traits:action:disable-a-device] (Trained)</p><p>@Check[type:lore: Lich|dc:26|name:Displace the enchantments|traits:action:disable-a-device] (Trained)</p>"
        },
