        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A soul cage is targeted by a spell</p><hr /><p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per soul cage</p><p><strong>Effect</strong> The soul cage tries to counteract the spell by attempting an @Check[type:arcana]{Counteract Check} using Lich Faltyr’s skill bonus for its counteract check. If it successfully counteracts the spell, the effect is turned back on the caster, using all statistics of the original cast (Including spell DCs and attack rolls).</p>"
